{%- comment -%}
  Snippet: bbi-homepage-faq — HOMEPAGE-CONTENT-DENSITY Commit 2b (2026-05-30)

  Visible homepage FAQ accordion — 5 Q&As condensed from /pages/faq (ds-lp-faq.liquid),
  one per defensible theme: ordering, NET 30, OECM/2025-470, delivery, space planning.
  Rendered from a custom-liquid section (bbi-faq) in templates/index.json, between
  bbi-services and bbi-work.

  The machine-readable FAQPage JSON-LD for these exact 5 Q&As lives in
  bbi-homepage-schema.liquid (all homepage page-specific schema kept in one file).
  Answer TEXT here and in that FAQPage node are kept identical — if you edit one,
  edit the other.

  Scoped to .hp-faq + [data-hp-faq-trigger] so the accordion JS cannot collide with
  the /pages/faq accordion (which uses .lp-faq / [data-faq-trigger]).

  Delivery footprint (Leo, 2026-05-30): "delivery across Canada, installation in
  Ontario and Western Canada" — matches the homepage bbi-about section. NOTE:
  /pages/faq still says "deliver across Ontario" — flagged for reconciliation.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="bbi-section hp-faq" aria-labelledby="hp-faq-title">
  <div class="bbi-container">
    <div class="bbi-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="bbi-section-head__eyebrow">Common questions</p>
        <h2 class="bbi-section-head__title" id="hp-faq-title">Ordering, OECM, delivery — answered.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="bbi-btn bbi-btn--secondary" href="/pages/faq">See all FAQs</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hp-faq__list" role="list">
      <div class="hp-faq__item" role="listitem">
        <button class="hp-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false" data-hp-faq-trigger>
          <span class="hp-faq__num">01</span>
          How do I place an order?
          <svg class="hp-faq__chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="hp-faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>Call <a href="tel:18008359565">1-800-835-9565</a> or request a quote online. We&rsquo;ll confirm product availability, pricing, and delivery timeline &mdash; typically within 1 business day. Standard in-stock items can be ordered directly on the website.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-faq__item" role="listitem">
        <button class="hp-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false" data-hp-faq-trigger>
          <span class="hp-faq__num">02</span>
          Do you offer NET 30 terms?
          <svg class="hp-faq__chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="hp-faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>Yes. NET 30 credit accounts are available to approved institutional buyers &mdash; municipalities, school boards, healthcare organizations, and registered non-profits. New accounts prepay the first order by credit card or EFT.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-faq__item" role="listitem">
        <button class="hp-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false" data-hp-faq-trigger>
          <span class="hp-faq__num">03</span>
          What is OECM and how does it benefit my organization?
          <svg class="hp-faq__chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="hp-faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>OECM is a group purchasing organization for Ontario&rsquo;s broader public sector. As an OECM Supplier Partner (Agreement 2025-470), Brant Business Interiors offers pre-negotiated pricing that eligible institutions can access without going to open tender.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-faq__item" role="listitem">
        <button class="hp-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false" data-hp-faq-trigger>
          <span class="hp-faq__num">04</span>
          Do you deliver across Canada?
          <svg class="hp-faq__chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="hp-faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>Yes. We deliver across Canada, with installation in Ontario and Western Canada. Delivery and installation timelines are confirmed with your quote.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-faq__item" role="listitem">
        <button class="hp-faq__trigger" aria-expanded="false" data-hp-faq-trigger>
          <span class="hp-faq__num">05</span>
          Do you offer space planning?
          <svg class="hp-faq__chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="hp-faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>Yes &mdash; free of charge for qualifying projects. Our design team produces a scaled floor plan showing furniture placement, traffic flow, and sightlines. Qualifying projects are typically 5 or more workstations or a full-room fit-out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hp-faq__list { border-top: 1px solid var(--bbi-line, #E5E5E7); margin-top: var(--space-8, 32px); }
  .hp-faq__item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bbi-line, #E5E5E7); }
  .hp-faq__trigger {
    all: unset; box-sizing: border-box;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    width: 100%; padding: 22px 0; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--headingFont); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--textColor);
  }
  .hp-faq__trigger:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--saleBadgeBackground, #D4252A); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .hp-faq__num {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 400; color: var(--textColor); opacity: 0.55; width: 28px;
  }
  .hp-faq__chevron {
    width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--textColor); opacity: 0.55;
    transition: transform 200ms ease, opacity 160ms ease;
  }
  .hp-faq__item--open .hp-faq__chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); opacity: 1; }
  .hp-faq__item--open .hp-faq__num { opacity: 1; }
  .hp-faq__answer { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--textColor); opacity: 0.78; padding: 0 0 20px calc(28px + 16px); }
  .hp-faq__answer p { margin: 0; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .hp-faq__answer a { color: var(--textColor); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-hp-faq-trigger]').forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var item = btn.closest('.hp-faq__item');
      var answer = item.querySelector('.hp-faq__answer');
      var isOpen = item.classList.contains('hp-faq__item--open');
      item.classList.toggle('hp-faq__item--open', !isOpen);
      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!isOpen));
      answer.hidden = isOpen;
    });
  });
</script>
